AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000939> "Though inaginal discs are sometimes described as “epithelial sacs”, we do not classify them as such, because an “epithelial sac” is defined in Uberon as being a single epithelium, whereas imaginal discs are made of several epithelia with distinct properties.")
